- [x] `audit/win_c_emit_deep.oot` (sub-agent L). Deep re-walk of every `#include`, `__attribute__`, and inline asm in `ooda/oodac/emit_c.oo`. Confirmed: C emit is 100% portable to mingw-w64 MSVCRT with the 6 includes the chs_rt runtime already provides. No new POSIX-only constructs in the emit path itself. The chs_rt gate from build test step 6 is the only blocker.
