## 5. What I will NOT do

- I will not edit `ooda/oodac/`, `ooda/runtime/`, `ooda/cli/`, or `ooda/install/`. The compiler, runtime, cli, and tooling owners do that.
- I will not run `oodac_pure_build` or `ooda install` to produce a Windows build. The seed-compile path is owned by the compiler lane.
- I will not run mingw or any Windows-target gcc on this host to produce a real Windows .exe. Build tests done in Phase 0 are smoke tests (C+mingw and oodac emit-c) to prove portability; the runnable .exe is the runtime lane's deliverable.

